 "text": "-->\nLawrence County, Missouri, county government\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nLawrence County, Missouri\nYour County Government at Work\nHOME\nANNOUNCEMENTS\nOFFICES\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Commission\nHealth Department\nProsecuting attorney\nEmergency Management\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nELECTIONS\nABOUT\nROADS\nJOBS\nPERMITS\nEnterprise zone\nPlanning & zoning\nLaw Enforcement Center\nLegal Disclaimer - Accessibility\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nPRINT TAX RECEIPT\nSAMPLE BALLOT\nNEED A 911 ADDRESS ASSIGNED?\nMost county offices are open 8 a.m.-4 p.m. weekdays, except holidays.\nHISTORIC COURTHOUSE, 1 Courthouse Square, Mt. Vernon, Missouri\nCounty Clerk / Elections , 417-466-2638\nCounty Collector , 417-466-2410. Pay by phone: 1-800-652-0405\nTax receipts, statements, available on Collector's web site .\nRecorder of Deeds , 417-466-2670\nCounty Assessor , 417-466-2831, fax 417-466-3931\nYou can now file assessment lists online .\nCounty Commission , 417-466-3666\nCounty Treasurer , 417-466-2662\nEmergency Management , 417-461-1077\nJUSTICE CENTER, 240 N. Main St., Mt. Vernon, Missouri\nCircuit Clerk , 417-466-2471\nProsecuting Attorney , 417-466-2846\nPublic Administrator , 417-466-2273\nHEALTH DEPARTMENT, 1549 Missouri Dr., Mt. Vernon, Missouri\nLAW ENFORCEMENT CENTER, 1525 Missouri Dr., Mt. Vernon, Missouri\nNews & Announcements\nCalendar\nOCT. 20 - No-excuse in person voting begins at County Clerk's Office, Historic Courthouse\nOCT. 31 - County Clerk's Office open 9-noon Saturday for in-person voting.\nNOV. 3 - General Election. Polls open 6 a.m.-7 p.m.\nLegal Disclaimer - Accessbility Notice\nbottom of page",
